    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Notice</strong>: Base game only includes Chapter 1 of the game, more chapters will be added in later updates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852390/extras/fab48b6554aeb648184c2ce987e247f1.avif?t=1754298936\" width=500 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You've awakened inside of a train with no memory of ever boarding... </h2>Something appears to be weird about this train.<br>Maybe it's the surprisingly clean environment, maybe it's the windows that are just a bit too hard to see out of.<br><br>Or maybe it's the fact that the train appears to be never ending, constantly looping back on itself enough to drive any passenger mad!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852390/extras/2ffa676ea6655497ec08e518c79bfa4f.avif?t=1754298936\" width=500 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something is weirding me out about this place.. But I can't put my finger on what?</h2>Welcome to <strong>Your Turn to Disembark</strong>, a episodic narrative adventure game about finding your way out of this strange and unnerving train with the help of 8 other bizarre passengers.<br><br>In this mystery adventure game you will be talking to the various passengers who are also stuck upon this train and trying to escape together.<br>Learn about their pasts and futures, their struggles and their strengths.<br>Some will become your friends, some may snap...<br><br>Walk around the train to try and discover it's secrets!<br>And maybe, finally figure out what really is going on in this locomotive...",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Notice</strong>: Base game only includes Chapter 1 of the game, more chapters will be added in later updates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852390/extras/fab48b6554aeb648184c2ce987e247f1.avif?t=1754298936\" width=500 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You've awakened inside of a train with no memory of ever boarding... </h2>Something appears to be weird about this train.<br>Maybe it's the surprisingly clean environment, maybe it's the windows that are just a bit too hard to see out of.<br><br>Or maybe it's the fact that the train appears to be never ending, constantly looping back on itself enough to drive any passenger mad!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852390/extras/2ffa676ea6655497ec08e518c79bfa4f.avif?t=1754298936\" width=500 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something is weirding me out about this place.. But I can't put my finger on what?</h2>Welcome to <strong>Your Turn to Disembark</strong>, a episodic narrative adventure game about finding your way out of this strange and unnerving train with the help of 8 other bizarre passengers.<br><br>In this mystery adventure game you will be talking to the various passengers who are also stuck upon this train and trying to escape together.<br>Learn about their pasts and futures, their struggles and their strengths.<br>Some will become your friends, some may snap...<br><br>Walk around the train to try and discover it's secrets!<br>And maybe, finally figure out what really is going on in this locomotive...",
